# Vita GPU Probe Configuration

config VITA_GPU_PROBE
	bool "Vita SGX543MP4+ Read-Only Probe (G2)"
	depends on ARCH_VITA
	help
	  This is a READ-ONLY probe for the Vita's PowerVR SGX543MP4+ GPU.
	  It enables the GPU clock, deasserts reset, maps the register block,
	  and reads ID/revision/status registers — printing them to dmesg.
	  
	  NO GPU WRITES are performed beyond clock/reset enable.
	  
	  This is the G2 gate in the reverse-engineering plan:
	  https://github.com/.../androidonvita/docs/reverse-engineering.md
	  
	  If this probe hangs the bus or reads an invalid ID, the GPU
	  reverse-engineering track stops here.
	  
	  Enable only for research builds. Not for production kernels.